# ROVEXO SUPREME BLOOD CODE II — ZERO REGRESSION

**STATUS: OWNER APPROVED · PERMANENT FREEZE · ABSOLUTE AUTHORITY**

SSOT: `lib/supreme-blood-code-ii-v1.ts`  
Doc: `docs/engineering/SUPREME_BLOOD_CODE_II_V1.md`

## Hard stop

Nothing may be **committed · pushed · merged · certified · frozen · released** unless **all** gates PASS.

## Mandatory order

CODE → TYPESCRIPT → ESLINT → BUILD → TESTS → PREVIEW → UI → MOBILE → TABLET → DESKTOP → OWNER APPROVAL → FREEZE → COMMIT → PUSH → CERTIFICATION → DONE

## Machine green ≠ product green

| Machine | Product defect | Result |
|---------|----------------|--------|
| BUILD PASS | White screen | **NOT APPROVED** |
| TEST PASS | Broken UI | **NOT APPROVED** |
| ESLINT PASS | Button broken | **NOT APPROVED** |
| BUILD PASS | Pay Now incorrect | **NOT APPROVED** |
| CODE PASS | Preview fail | **NOT APPROVED** |

## Certification blocked

No preview · No UI · No Owner approval · No mobile PASS → **NO CERTIFICATION**

## White-screen policy

If the user sees white/empty/broken page, broken button, wrong status/total/payment/tracking/automation → **sprint FAILS automatically**. No exceptions.

## Binary only

Only **PASS** or **FAIL**. Forbidden: Fake / Partial / Estimated / Assume / Probably / Should / Might / Almost PASS.

## Score law

95% · 99% · 99.99% ≠ 100%. Only **exactly 100% PASS** or **FAIL**.

## Golden QA

**1 failure = entire gate FAIL.** Example: Build/Tests/UI PASS + Preview FAIL → Sprint FAIL.

## Older freezes

May improve · optimize · automate · secure.  
May **never** break · remove · change · duplicate without Owner approval.

## Never sacrifice

Quality for speed · Security for convenience · Automation for manual ops · Scalability for short-term hacks.

## Owner rule

Owner must never ask “Is it working?” — the platform must **prove** it works, passes, is tested, verified, certified.

## Final supreme rule

If it is not tested · verified · previewed · approved · certified → **it does not exist.**

No preview = no freeze. No PASS = no push. No Owner approval = no certification. **No exceptions.**

Child law: Supreme Blood Code III — Preview View Certification (`lib/supreme-blood-code-iii-v1.ts`).

## Cursor must never

- Claim PASS without verified evidence  
- Treat 99.x% as 100%  
- Commit/push/certify when any gate failed or preview/UI/mobile missing  
- Bypass Owner approval between gates
